        "density": 0.01308,
        "chars": 361,
        "chars_per_1k_ink": 48.45
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        353,
        1977,
        2020,
        2195
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "In view of the City's critical need for increased revenue, please review the practices and current fees of your agency and advise me by January 31, 1972, of your findings and your plans for revision.",
